cra://debug?externalURL=${PAGE}?n=menu
wait 2
# Ten spaces: 350 pt of list under the 46 pt header, the space in use (Personal) first.
cra://debug?littleMenu=open
expect-log little menu open: chevron=1 menu=244x396 top=4 right=4 rows=10 first=Personal selected=Personal scroll=0 inView=1 empty=0
snapshot LittleSpacesPopup little-open-in-menu
# ↓ to the last space scrolls it into view (Arc 1.172.1 moves the highlight out of sight; Cra follows it).
cra://debug?littleMenu=down9
expect-log little menu down9: chevron=1 menu=244x396 top=4 right=4 rows=10 first=Personal selected=India scroll=110 inView=1 empty=0
# The filter: no match, then one ("alp": Alpha).
cra://debug?littleMenu=type:zzq
expect-log little menu type:zzq: chevron=1 menu=244x110 top=4 right=4 rows=0 first=- selected=- scroll=0 inView=0 empty=1
cra://debug?littleMenu=type:alp
expect-log little menu type:alp: chevron=1 menu=244x92 top=4 right=4 rows=1 first=Alpha selected=Alpha scroll=0 inView=1 empty=0
cra://debug?littleMenu=close
expect-log little menu close: chevron=1 menu=closed

# Picked in the Little Window (#316): that space leads the menu.
cra://debug?littleCommit=bravo
